  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Air transport plays an essential role in providing aid and relief during and after a disaster. Airports are important hubs for humanitarian assistance and disaster response. The continued support and influx of goods and supplies is dependent on air transport. During a disaster, airports become staging points for rescuers, relief supplies, goods deliveries, and people evacuation."
